{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/975797-feras-and-relationships-with-garous","id":975797,"title":"Feras and Relationships with Garous","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-24T20:20:32-07:00","id":975797,"title":"Feras and Relationships with Garous","content":"So.. my Current pack is heading to the Amazon and one of the players is wondering about how do Feras react to garous and if its possible to &quot;Date a Bastet.&quot;<br /> which made me think, how do feras feel about garous when it comes to partnerships and such?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-24T21:17:02-07:00","id":975817,"title":"","content":"Depends on which sourcebook you read. Some do seem to show fera generally distrust garou, and visa versa, while others show that there is Some cooperation that goes on in times of necessity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-24T22:01:22-07:00","id":975829,"title":"","content":"Amazon is Fera heavy with Bastet (Balam) and Mokole. They are generally not on friendly terms with Garou. There is a lot of bad blood and mistrust with them. Any alliances are generally short lived as bad blood will resurface and they each have their own duties to do as well. There are groups of mixed Fera out there like the Beast Courts out East and the Ahadi in Africa. That's outside the norm though. If the pack wants to make friends with the Fera, and in the Amazon being humble is a life saving skill, then they will need to work hard at it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1250-shadowlost","name":"Shadowlost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-24T23:04:31-07:00","id":975844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowlost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/975797-feras-and-relationships-with-garous?p=975829#post975829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Amazon is Fera heavy with Bastet (Balam) and Mokole. They are generally not on friendly terms with Garou. There is a lot of bad blood and mistrust with them. Any alliances are generally short lived as bad blood will resurface and they each have their own duties to do as well. There are groups of mixed Fera out there like the Beast Courts out East and the Ahadi in Africa. That's outside the norm though. If the pack wants to make friends with the Fera, and in the Amazon being humble is a life saving skill, then they will need to work hard at it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah the majority of Fera is &quot;Outside the Norm&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-25T07:09:33-07:00","id":975933,"title":"","content":"Well, the Ahadi are a new phenomena, but they probably include 1/12th of Terrestrial Fera. The Beast Courts may include 1/4th of Terrestrial Fera. The majority of Terrestrial Fera are probably going to be Ananasi and Ratkin, neither of which joined either organization in large numbers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","user":"Aya Tari","date":". 09-25-2016, 10:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-25T09:21:25-07:00","id":975967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/975797-feras-and-relationships-with-garous?p=975933#post975933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, the Ahadi are a new phenomena, but they probably include 1/12th of Terrestrial Fera. The Beast Courts may include 1/4th of Terrestrial Fera. The majority of Terrestrial Fera are probably going to be Ananasi and Ratkin, neither of which joined either organization in large numbers.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nezumi Join the Emerald Courts in Large numbers. The majority of Fera by type and Geography are in those two areas<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}